---
title: Negroni Sbagliato
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, aperitivo]
source: Classic cocktail, number 36 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Fill a #rocks glass{} with ice. Pour in @Campari{1%fl_oz} and @sweet vermouth{1%fl_oz}, top with @prosecco{1%fl_oz}, and stir once, gently. Garnish with an @orange{1%slice}.

> "Sbagliato" means mistaken: sparkling wine where the gin should be. Bar Basso, Milan.
